但我们知道，当我们长大后，当那些肮脏的笑话或双关语最终对我们来说有意义时，我们偶尔会目瞪口呆地看着。

01:04:25.340 --> 01:04:31.139
I watched every episode of him every week until the last episode that aired less than a month before I turned 15.
我每周都会看他的每一集，直到最后一集在我 15 岁之前不到一个月播出。

01:04:31.139 --> 01:04:39.860
I felt my father's presence while also being able to feel myself shape into the woman I was becoming over these seasons, a feeling I'll have with no other show.
我感觉到父亲的存在，同时也能感觉到自己在这些季节中逐渐成为一个女人，这种感觉是我在其他节目中找不到的。

01:04:39.860 --> 01:04:47.619
My father was only 33 when he passed away, which obviously I had no comprehension whatsoever about still being a young age to pass away.
我父亲去世时年仅33岁，显然我无法理解他这么年轻就去世了。

01:04:47.619 --> 01:05:06.699
The gang growing up and growing old together, having adventures through their 30s, still having things to figure out made me understand how much life there is to live, how much we can miss out for ourselves when we don't embrace the now and the future, and how important it is to have hope these sentiments have pushed me out of my darkest moments and into the light.
这群人一起成长，一起变老，经历了30多岁的冒险，仍然有很多事情需要解决，让我明白了还有多少生活可以过，如果我们不拥抱现在和未来，我们会错过多少自己，以及抱有希望是多么重要，这些情感将我从最黑暗的时刻推向光明。

01:05:06.699 --> 01:05:16.699
My grief shifted from anger at the world, blossoming into finding pockets for the love I feel for people in the past future and present, which I fully attribute to the characters of the show, especially Ted.
我的悲伤从对世界的愤怒转变为寻找我对过去、未来和现在的人们的爱，我将这种爱完全归功于剧中的人物，尤其是泰德。

01:05:16.699 --> 01:05:23.121
